text:
Father Yahweh, we thank You for every blessing You have given us;
our health, our families, our work, and every open door in our lives.
We acknowledge that every good gift comes from Your hand alone. Forgive us when pride enters our hearts and when we begin to trust in our own strength, wisdom, or achievements instead of You. Keep us humble under the covering of Your cloud, remembering that all we have and all we are comes from You. Teach us to give You the glory for every success, every provision, and every fruit that comes from our lives. Protect us from self-sufficiency and help us remain deeply rooted in faith and obedience to You. Unless You build the house, our labour is in vain, so keep us walking under Your care and guidance until the end. In Christ’s name we pray, Amen.
